Rule 17 (batch dimensions of LHS and RHS must match exactly)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ndim(v_2) ≥ 3 ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i))
>>
Rule 18 (Dimensions of both tensors must be at least 3 for batch matrix multiplication)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 20 (The batch dimensions of the two input tensors must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 21 (The contracting dimension of the lhs tensor must equal the second-to-last dimension of the rhs tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 3 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)
>>
Rule 24 (The first batch dimension of both input tensors must be equal)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 3 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
