Rule 25 (For 4-dimensional batch matrix multiplication, the first two batch dimensions of both tensors must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 4 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1)
